WEBVTT

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.616
before I could even process
what was going on,

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.760
Jonathan intentionally pulled my blouse,

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:39.720
and I fell back, thinking that I was dead.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:44.616
And in that instant, when I looked up,

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:48.440
Jonathan Daniels
was standing in the line of fire,

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.480
and he took the blast,

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:54.720
and he saved my life.